<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Choose a loan for the interest</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Choose a principal, a rate and a time so that the simple interest is exactly Ksh \({@ksh(I)@}\). Your rate must be from \(5\%\) to \(20\%\) per annum and your time from \(1\) to \(6\) years. Many answers are correct.</p><p>\(P =\) Ksh [[input:ansP]] [[validation:ansP]]</p><p>\(R =\) [[input:ansR]] % per annum [[validation:ansR]]</p><p>\(T =\) [[input:ansT]] years [[validation:ansT]]</p><p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Any \(P\), \(R\) and \(T\) inside the rules with \(PRT = 100 \times {@ksh(I)@}\) is correct. Choose \(R\) and \(T\) first, then \(P = \dfrac{100 \times {@ksh(I)@}}{RT}\).</p><p>For example, \(R = 10\) and \(T = 3\) give \(P = \dfrac{100 \times {@ksh(I)@}}{30} = {@ksh(Ps)@}\). Check: \(\dfrac{{@ksh(Ps)@} \times 10 \times 3}{100} = {@ksh(I)@}\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[kgrp(n) := block([s, out, k], s: string(n), k: slength(s), if k < 5 then s else (out: "", while k > 3 do (out: sconcat("\\,", substring(s, k-2, k+1), out), k: k-3), sconcat(substring(s, 1, k+1), out)));
ksh(v) := block([c, w, f], c: floor(100*v+1/2), w: floor(c/100), f: c-100*w, if f = 0 then kgrp(w) else sconcat(kgrp(w), ".", if f < 10 then "0" else "", string(f)));
dd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else if integerp(10*v) then dispdp(float(v),1) else if integerp(100*v) then dispdp(float(v),2) else if integerp(1000*v) then dispdp(float(v),3) else dispdp(float(v),4);
ix: 1+rand(10);
/* Design: construct-an-example pattern. Target interest I; rules 5 <= R <= 20, 1 <= T <= 6, P > 0. Source: original. */
L: [6000,7200,9000,10800,12600,15000,18000,4800,8400,13500];
I: L[ix];
Ps: 100*I/30;
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
  <specificfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[]]></text></specificfeedback>
  <questionnote format="moodle_auto_format">
    <text>ix={@ix@}, I={@I@}</text>
  </questionnote>
